      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "id": "t70",
      "text": "FAILBACK (run in EAST):  reverse CDC west\u2192east via dr_remote_west pulls outage-time versions; write FAILBACK row; dr_state \u2192 east.  Steady state restored.",
